<p class="callout callout-note">To see this controller in action, visit <a href="{{ '/getting-started/' | url }}">Getting Started</a> on desktop. The "On this page" sidebar highlights the current section as you scroll.</p>

<h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>

<pre><code class="language-html">&lt;nav data-controller="toc" data-toc-offset-value="100"&gt;
  &lt;a href="#section-1" data-toc-target="link" data-id="section-1"&gt;
    Section 1
  &lt;/a&gt;
  &lt;a href="#section-2" data-toc-target="link" data-id="section-2"&gt;
    Section 2
  &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/nav&gt;</code></pre>

